msgid "How your name reads next to your posts and comments and on your profile, with your <code>@%(name)s</code> beside it. It can be anything up to 50 characters, with spaces and emoji, and you can change it whenever you like at no cost. It is not unique and not an address: people still find you, mention you and link to you by your username."
